From c9b9e410efef1dc913f732b4d02fdbbb4d646d2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andre <andre@rng.media>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:01:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] DeckDuck: RNG Media patches on DeckCraft

Name, duck icon as the in-app logo, Home/About/Info without Discord links,
glass graphite dark theme with red accent, upstream self-update off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
