 .../512x512/apps/ai.storyteller.deckcraft.png | Bin 20164 -> 308538 bytes
 .../64x64/apps/ai.storyteller.deckcraft.png   | Bin 2519 -> 10162 bytes
 crates/ui-egui/Cargo.toml                     |   1 +
 crates/ui-egui/src/backstage/files.rs         |   5 +--
 crates/ui-egui/src/backstage/info.rs          |   6 +--
 crates/ui-egui/src/dialogs.rs                 |   4 +-
