 - Licences: About now has a Licences tab (also Help > Licences) showing the credit line and the embedded `LICENSE-MIT`, `LICENSE-APACHE` and `NOTICE`; the `NOTICE` trademark paragraph and `ATTRIBUTION.md` were updated; this file was added.
-- Packaging: Linux (`.desktop`, metainfo, nfpm vendor/homepage/maintainer, AppImage, Flatpak), macOS (`Info.plist`, app/DMG names), and Windows (MSI product name, manufacturer, new UpgradeCode, install folder `RNGMedia\DeckDuck`, registry keys, ProgId) use DeckDuck names.
